<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank sets three repo tenders at max 45 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank sets three repo tenders at max 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Tuesday set three repo tenders with a maximum rate of 45 percent, unchanged from similar tenders on Monday.</p>
<p>The CNB said in a statement that one tender would be for the period May 20-21, while the second is for May 21-22 and the third for May 22-23.</p>
